### Criar mesas
POST {{host}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 1,
  "capacidade": 4,
  "localizacao": "Área interna"
}

###

POST {{host}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 2,
  "capacidade": 2,
  "localizacao": "Área externa"
}

###

POST {{host}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": 3,
  "capacidade": 6,
  "localizacao": "Salão principal"
}

###

### Listar mesas ativas
GET {{host}}/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar todas (incluindo inativas)
GET {{host}}/mesas?todas=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Resumo de ocupação (dashboard)
GET {{host}}/mesas/ocupacao
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar mesa por ID
GET {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar status para ocupada
PATCH {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OCUPADA"
}

###

### Liberar mesa
PATCH {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "LIVRE"
}

###

### Atualizar dados da mesa
PUT {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacidade": 7,
  "localizacao": "Salão VIP"
}

###

### Desativar mesa (soft delete)
DELETE {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Reativar mesa
PATCH {{host}}/mesas/{{mesa_id}}/reativar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### QR Code — rota pública (sem token)
GET {{host}}/mesas/qrcode/{{qr_token}}